        marker = "*",
        depth = 1,
        instruction = "The Penguin Ring is recommended to be able to more easily weaken the more stubborn Gugrusaurus and Lik. If not using one of the EX baits, it is also recommended to use an Albatross Ring at the same time to allow yourself enough time to land the catch.",
